    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A Song of degrees.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 123:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unto thee lift I up mine eyes, O thou that dwellest in the heavens.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.123.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.123.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 123:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, as the eyes of servants",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.123.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.123.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "look",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.123.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.123.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto the hand of their masters,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.123.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.123.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.123.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.123.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as the eyes of a maiden unto the hand of her mistress; so our eyes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.123.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.123.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "wait",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.123.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.123.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.123.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.123.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.123.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.123.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "our God, until that he have mercy upon us.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.123.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.123.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 123:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Have mercy upon us, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.123.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.123.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.123.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.123.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", have mercy upon us: for we are exceedingly filled with contempt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.123.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.123.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 123:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Our soul is exceedingly filled with the scorning of those that are at ease,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.123.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.123.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.123.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.123.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with the contempt of the proud.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.123.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.123.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
